{"4730460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Farm Bang", "steam_appid": 4730460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up on a strange planet with a Gatling Gun in one hand and a debt notice in the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you'll need to hatch living ammo, battle strange creatures, haul increasingly ridiculous loot, and somehow keep up with an interstellar bank that never stops collecting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Farm Bang.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Raise Your Ammo</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your bullets are alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine eggs and food to grow different living ammo types, each with unique combat behavior and upgrade paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch. Load. Fire. Repeat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/13fc1aae7bed5eddf80e47c6b21b3104.poster.avif?t=1788077273\" width=624 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/13fc1aae7bed5eddf80e47c6b21b3104.webm?t=1788077273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/13fc1aae7bed5eddf80e47c6b21b3104.mp4?t=1788077273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weaponize Chaos</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn adorable ammo into devastating firepower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create black holes, fire piercing shots, unleash homing projectiles, and use recoil to launch yourself out of danger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/8ab81f526c89d9b8cde17423e4bba21f.poster.avif?t=1788077273\" width=624 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/8ab81f526c89d9b8cde17423e4bba21f.webm?t=1788077273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/8ab81f526c89d9b8cde17423e4bba21f.mp4?t=1788077273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/a9530dabc56f86c05ed42a4bdcbea2f6.poster.avif?t=1788077273\" width=624 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/a9530dabc56f86c05ed42a4bdcbea2f6.webm?t=1788077273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/a9530dabc56f86c05ed42a4bdcbea2f6.mp4?t=1788077273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Carry Your Fortune</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot has weight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heavier the prize, the greater the reward, but dragging massive treasure home may slow you down enough to get caught.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/edd645c89ec14e042d045dc02d54d7f7.poster.avif?t=1788077273\" width=624 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/edd645c89ec14e042d045dc02d54d7f7.webm?t=1788077273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/edd645c89ec14e042d045dc02d54d7f7.mp4?t=1788077273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pay Your Debt... or Run</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bank always comes for what it owns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss your payment, and the Collector will arrive to enforce repayment personally.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/69e36c4979e6fdbb69c8caf69cf5e2af.poster.avif?t=1788077273\" width=624 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/69e36c4979e6fdbb69c8caf69cf5e2af.webm?t=1788077273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/69e36c4979e6fdbb69c8caf69cf5e2af.mp4?t=1788077273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Survival Strategy</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your skills, optimize your economy, and evolve your ammo to survive longer against both monsters and capitalism.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/c4dfca04fe4f3bba9e324c019129e58c.poster.avif?t=1788077273\" width=624 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/c4dfca04fe4f3bba9e324c019129e58c.webm?t=1788077273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/c4dfca04fe4f3bba9e324c019129e58c.mp4?t=1788077273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/e84c6879d03fca3185a27085fa59c68f.poster.avif?t=1788077273\" width=624 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/e84c6879d03fca3185a27085fa59c68f.webm?t=1788077273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/e84c6879d03fca3185a27085fa59c68f.mp4?t=1788077273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Raise living ammunition from eggs and food  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Experiment with multiple ammo types and combat evolutions  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hunt monsters and collect loot with dynamic weight tiers  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Sell, upgrade, and manage a growing debt  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Survive escalating debt collector encounters  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unlock powerful skills and permanent upgrades  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Experience a strange blend of farming, combat, and financial panic</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up on a strange planet with a Gatling Gun in one hand and a debt notice in the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you'll need to hatch living ammo, battle strange creatures, haul increasingly ridiculous loot, and somehow keep up with an interstellar bank that never stops collecting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Farm Bang.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Raise Your Ammo</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your bullets are alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine eggs and food to grow different living ammo types, each with unique combat behavior and upgrade paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch. Load. Fire. Repeat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/13fc1aae7bed5eddf80e47c6b21b3104.poster.avif?t=1788077273\" width=624 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/13fc1aae7bed5eddf80e47c6b21b3104.webm?t=1788077273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/13fc1aae7bed5eddf80e47c6b21b3104.mp4?t=1788077273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weaponize Chaos</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn adorable ammo into devastating firepower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create black holes, fire piercing shots, unleash homing projectiles, and use recoil to launch yourself out of danger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/8ab81f526c89d9b8cde17423e4bba21f.poster.avif?t=1788077273\" width=624 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/8ab81f526c89d9b8cde17423e4bba21f.webm?t=1788077273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/8ab81f526c89d9b8cde17423e4bba21f.mp4?t=1788077273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/a9530dabc56f86c05ed42a4bdcbea2f6.poster.avif?t=1788077273\" width=624 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4730460/extras/a9